"<p>Nitrobase được thiết kế với trung tâm điều khiển (Control Plane) tinh gọn, giao tiếp với các máy chủ VPS được quản trị thông qua các giao thức an toàn.</p>\n<h2>Sơ đồ kiến trúc tổng thể</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">flowchart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Panel</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Bảng điều khiển Nitrobase </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Host / VPS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    direction</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    UI</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Web UI (Mantine 9 + TanStack Router)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Nitro</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Nitro Server (React 19, Bun)&#x3C;br/>• Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL&#x3C;br/>• Job Queue &#x26; Lập lịch Croner&#x3C;br/>• WebSocket xterm.js Web PTY\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  Panel </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-->|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SSH2 / ed25519</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Remote</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Máy chủ VPS từ xa (Remote VPS)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  Panel </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-->|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nsenter / Docker socket</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Localhost (Máy chủ chạy Nitrobase)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Remote</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Máy chủ VPS từ xa </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Remote VPS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    direction TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Traefik v3 (Reverse Proxy + ACME SSL)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Supabase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bộ ngăn xếp Supabase&#x3C;br/>(PostgreSQL Vector, GoTrue, Studio)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Appwrite</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Appwrite / Các mẫu ứng dụng khác\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Localhost </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Máy chủ chạy Nitrobase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    direction TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Traefik v3 (Reverse Proxy + ACME SSL)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> App</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Container Nitrobase\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> DB</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PostgreSQL 16 Engine\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Các nguyên lý thiết kế cốt lõi</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Tiến trình đơn (Single-Instance In-Process):</strong> Các background job, tác vụ cron và khóa server lock được vận hành trực tiếp trong tiến trình bộ nhớ của Nitrobase, đảm bảo không xung đột và không cần cài thêm Redis.</li>\n<li><strong>Không cài đặt Agent nặng nề:</strong> Các server từ xa chỉ chạy Docker và Traefik v3 tiêu chuẩn. Nitrobase không cài daemon chạy ngầm làm chậm máy chủ của bạn.</li>\n<li><strong>An toàn kiểu dữ liệu toàn diện (Type Safety):</strong> 100% mã nguồn TypeScript đồng bộ từ cơ sở dữ liệu (Drizzle ORM), Zod validation cho tới giao diện người dùng React 19.</li>\n</ol>"